<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>인공지능 중점반 방과후 캠프 3개년 로드맵 플래너</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- FontAwesome Icons for Beautiful UI -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <!-- Google Fonts (Noto Sans KR & Montserrat) -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;600;800&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ['Noto Sans KR', 'sans-serif'],
            mono: ['Montserrat', 'sans-serif'],
          },
          colors: {
            brand: {
              50: '#f5f7ff',
              100: '#ebf0ff',
              500: '#3b82f6',
              600: '#2563eb',
              700: '#1d4ed8',
              900: '#1e3a8a',
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }
    .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
    }
    .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
      background: #f1f1f1;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
      background: #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .custom-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
      background: #94a3b8;
    }
    .fade-in {
      animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-out forwards;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased">

  <!-- Header Section -->
  <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-indigo-950 to-blue-900 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Abstract Tech Background Pattern -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#e2e8f0_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:16px_16px]"></div>
    
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 md:py-12 relative z-10">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-6">
        <div>
          <span class="bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider border border-blue-500/30">
            Future Tech Education
          </span>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mt-3 text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-100 to-blue-200">
            인공지능 중점반 방과후 캠프 3개년 로드맵
          </h1>
          <p class="text-slate-300 mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
            체계적인 인공지능, SW, 로봇, 반도체 커리큘럼을 통해 미래 테크 인재로 성장해 보세요. 
            <strong>졸업 전까지 총 7~8개의 캠프 이수를 목표</strong>로 개인 맞춤형 시뮬레이션을 돌려볼 수 있습니다.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="#planner" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/30 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i> 나만의 플래너 바로가기
          </a>
          <button onclick="resetPlanner()" class="bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl font-medium transition-all text-sm border border-slate-700">
            플래너 초기화 <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right ml-1"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Interactive Controls Section (Track selection & Stats) -->
  <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 -mt-6 relative z-20 w-full">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-5 md:p-6 border border-slate-100">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 items-start lg:items-center justify-between">
        <!-- Track selection buttons -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-auto">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 block mb-2">원하는 미래 진로 트랙을 선택해 보세요</span>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <button onclick="selectTrack('all')" id="track-btn-all" class="track-btn active px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-md">
              🌐 전체 코스 보기
            </button>
            <button onclick="selectTrack('ai')" id="track-btn-ai" class="track-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200">
              🤖 AI & SW 개발자 트랙
            </button>
            <button onclick="selectTrack('robot')" id="track-btn-robot" class="track-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200">
              🦾 로봇 & 임베디드 트랙
            </button>
            <button onclick="selectTrack('semi')" id="track-btn-semi" class="track-btn px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm transition-all bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200">
              💾 반도체 설계 트랙
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Real-time Planner Status Quick-view -->
        <div class="w-full lg:w-auto bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-200/60 flex items-center justify-between gap-6 self-stretch lg:self-auto">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500">나의 시뮬레이션 이수 계획</span>
              <span id="planner-status-badge" class="text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200">이수 부족</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1 mt-1">
              <span id="selected-count" class="text-2xl font-black text-indigo-600">0</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">/ 8개 이수함</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Mini Progress Bar -->
          <div class="flex-1 lg:w-32">
            <div class="w-full bg-slate-200 h-2.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
              <div id="planner-progress" class="bg-indigo-600 h-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 0%"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1 text-right font-medium">권장 이수: 7~8개</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Workspace -->
  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 w-full flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
    
    <!-- Left 3 Cols: Interactive Grid Timeline -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-10">
      
      <!-- Interactive Grid Filters -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center justify-between">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-blue-500"></i> 학기별 교과 배정표
        </h2>
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <!-- Search box -->
          <div class="relative">
            <input type="text" id="search-input" onkeyup="filterCourses()" placeholder="과목명 또는 기술 검색..." class="pl-9 pr-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 w-48 md:w-60 bg-white transition-all">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass absolute left-3 top-2.5 text-slate-400 text-xs"></i>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Category select -->
          <select id="category-filter" onchange="filterCourses()" class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 bg-white cursor-pointer text-slate-600">
            <option value="all">전체 분야</option>
            <option value="Programming">💻 프로그래밍</option>
            <option value="Humanoid">🤖 휴머노이드</option>
            <option value="AI">🧠 인공지능</option>
            <option value="Semiconductor">💾 반도체</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Timeline Container -->
      <div class="space-y-12 relative border-l-2 border-slate-200 pl-4 md:pl-6 ml-2 md:ml-4">
        
        <!-- ==================== 1학년 ==================== -->
        <div class="timeline-year fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">
          <!-- Grade Marker -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[14px] top-0 bg-blue-600 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/40">
            1
          </div>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 flex items-baseline gap-2">
              1학년 <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">AI &amp; HW 기초 체력 다지기 단계</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">블록 코딩, 로봇 조립, 파이썬 기초 문법을 통해 AI/HW의 기초적인 동작 구조를 탐색합니다.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
            <!-- 1학년 1학기 -->
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md inline-block">1학년 1학기</h4>
              <div class="space-y-3" id="group-1-1">
                <!-- Javascript will render or fallback loaded elements -->
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 1학년 2학기 + 여름방학 -->
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md inline-block">1학년 여름방학 &amp; 2학기</h4>
              <div class="space-y-3" id="group-1-2">
                <!-- Javascript -->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ==================== 2학년 ==================== -->
        <div class="timeline-year fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
          <!-- Grade Marker -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[14px] top-0 bg-indigo-600 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/40">
            2
          </div>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 flex items-baseline gap-2">
              2학년 <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">알고리즘 응용 및 실무 프로젝트 단계</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">파이썬 텍스트 코딩과 수학적 기법을 접목하고, 로봇 제어 및 반도체 하드웨어의 응용 기술을 탐구합니다.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
            <!-- 2학년 1학기 -->
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md inline-block">2학년 1학기</h4>
              <div class="space-y-3" id="group-2-1">
                <!-- Javascript -->
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 2학년 2학기 + 여름방학 -->
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md inline-block">2학년 여름방학 &amp; 2학기</h4>
              <div class="space-y-3" id="group-2-2">
                <!-- Javascript -->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ==================== 3학년 ==================== -->
        <div class="timeline-year fade-in" style="animation-delay: 0.3s">
          <!-- Grade Marker -->
          <div class="absolute -left-[14px] top-0 bg-violet-600 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold shadow-lg shadow-violet-500/40">
            3
          </div>
          <div class="mb-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 flex items-baseline gap-2">
              3학년 <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">심화 이론 및 대외 경쟁력 확보 (전문가 멘토링) 단계</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">심도 깊은 딥러닝 인프라 분석 및 5인 이하 소수 정예 팀 프로젝트를 구성하여 최종 특허 및 창업 모델을 수립합니다.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
            <!-- 3학년 1학기 -->
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md inline-block">3학년 1학기</h4>
              <div class="space-y-3" id="group-3-1">
                <!-- Javascript -->
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- 3학년 2학기 + 여름방학 -->
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-600 bg-indigo-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md inline-block">3학년 여름방학 &amp; 2학기</h4>
              <div class="space-y-3" id="group-3-2">
                <!-- Javascript -->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right 1 Col: Fixed/Sticky My Planner Dashboard -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-1 space-y-6">
      <div id="planner" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-100 p-5 md:p-6 sticky top-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-100 pb-4 mb-4">
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2 text-base">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-indigo-600"></i> 나의 방과후 계획서
          </h3>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded bg-slate-100 text-slate-600">실시간 검증</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Custom Track Selection Summary -->
        <div class="mb-4 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-3 border border-slate-100">
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">선택된 타겟 경로</p>
          <p id="target-track-label" class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 mt-0.5">🌐 전체 자유 코스 설계</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Selected Camps List Container -->
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">담은 방과후 캠프 리스트</p>
        <div id="planner-list" class="space-y-2 max-h-64 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar pr-1 mb-4">
          <!-- Dynamic contents loaded via JS -->
          <div class="text-center py-8 text-slate-400 border border-dashed border-slate-200 rounded-xl text-xs">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open text-xl mb-1.5 block text-slate-300"></i>
            교과목 옆의 <i class="fa-solid fa-plus text-[10px]"></i> 버튼을 눌러<br>이수 계획표에 담아보세요.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Status Validation Analysis Box -->
        <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-semibold">
            <span class="text-slate-500">이수 완료된 캠프</span>
            <span id="validation-count" class="text-slate-800">0 / 8개</span>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Requirement Validations Checklist -->
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[11px] text-slate-600 font-medium" id="validation-checklist">
            <li id="rule-qty" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-400">
              <i class="fa-regular fa-circle"></i> 최소 7개 ~ 최대 8개 선택
            </li>
            <li id="rule-prog" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-400">
              <i class="fa-regular fa-circle"></i> 프로그래밍 분야 포함 이수
            </li>
            <li id="rule-ai" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-400">
              <i class="fa-regular fa-circle"></i> 인공지능 분야 필수 이수
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div id="graduation-alert-box" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-center transition-all">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500" id="graduation-alert-text">설계를 시작해 보세요!</span>
          </div>

          <button onclick="exportPlan()" class="w-full bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all shadow-md mt-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down"></i> 내 계획안 텍스트로 복사
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Detail Modal Base -->
  <div id="detail-modal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full shadow-2xl overflow-hidden transform scale-95 transition-transform duration-300">
      
      <!-- Top header strip -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-900 to-blue-900 p-5 text-white relative">
        <button onclick="closeModal()" class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-white/80 hover:text-white transition-all text-lg">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
        </button>
        <span id="modal-category" class="bg-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded-md uppercase tracking-wide border border-blue-400/20">분야</span>
        <h3 id="modal-title" class="text-xl font-bold mt-2">과목 명칭</h3>
        <p id="modal-semester" class="text-xs text-indigo-200 mt-1">학년/학기 배치</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Content -->
      <div class="p-6 space-y-4 text-sm">
        <div>
          <span class="text-slate-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">기본 난이도</span>
          <span id="modal-difficulty" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">
            <!-- Difficulty Tag -->
          </span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span class="text-slate-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">상세 핵심 내용</span>
          <p id="modal-desc" class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-medium">상세 설명이 들어갑니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
          <span class="text-slate-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1.5">학습 도구 &amp; 언어</span>
          <p id="modal-tools" class="text-slate-800 font-semibold text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-cube text-indigo-500"></i> 오렌지3, 파이썬 등
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4">
          <span class="text-slate-400 font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">기대되는 산출물 포트폴리오</span>
          <p id="modal-portfolio" class="text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed bg-blue-50/50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-blue-100/50 text-indigo-950 font-medium">
            산출물에 대한 예시가 기재됩니다.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer Action -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 p-4 border-t border-slate-100 flex gap-2 justify-end">
        <button onclick="closeModal()" class="px-4 py-2 text-slate-500 text-xs font-semibold hover:bg-slate-100 rounded-lg transition-all">닫기</button>
        <button id="modal-add-btn" class="bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs hover:bg-indigo-500 transition-all shadow-md">내 로드맵에 추가</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Custom Alert Notification -->
  <div id="toast" class="fixed bottom-4 left-4 z-50 bg-slate-900 text-white px-4 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold transform translate-y-20 opacity-0 transition-all duration-300">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-green-400 text-base"></i>
    <span id="toast-message">알림 메시지</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-500 text-center py-8 border-t border-slate-800 text-xs mt-12">
